sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as Synthetic HTTPS client
  participant WAF as WAF rate rule
  participant API as API Gateway /prod/intake
  participant Lambda as Lambda (private VPC)
  participant DDB as DynamoDB (CMK)
  participant S3 as S3 uploads (CMK)
  participant Logs as CloudWatch Logs
  participant DLQ as SQS DLQ
  Client->>WAF: POST synthetic intake payload
  WAF->>API: allow under IP rate limit
  API->>Logs: structured access record
  API->>Lambda: invoke
  Lambda->>DDB: PutItem via DynamoDB endpoint
  Lambda->>S3: PutObject uploads/* via S3 endpoint
  Lambda-->>DLQ: failed invocation (if needed)
  Lambda-->>API: submission_id / received
  API-->>Client: HTTPS 200
